{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>And I am dust and ashes</b> — from here he merited the ashes of the red heifer and the dust of the sotah. עפר in gematria equals לשוטה (to a sotah) with a left שין, and אפר in gematria equals בפרה (in a heifer). עפר ואפר — two times in the Masorah: here and the other in Job, ונחמתי על עפר ואפר. And thus it is said: greater is what is said in Job than what is said in Abraham."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:27.509114641Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}